sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Dish as Dish
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Dish: reviseDetails(name, description, category, course, serviceStyle, dietaryTags)
    Note over Dish: Policies: dishRead, dishWrite, dishExecute
    Note over Dish: Guards (2)
    Dish->>Dish: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;active#quot;
    Dish->>Dish: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Dish->>Dish: mutate.name
    Dish->>Dish: mutate.description
    Dish->>Dish: mutate.category
    Dish->>Dish: mutate.course
    Dish->>Dish: mutate.serviceStyle
    Dish->>Dish: mutate.dietaryTags
    Dish->>EventBus: emit DishDetailsRevised on dish.details_revised
    Dish-->>-Client: void